---
import LeadForm from './LeadForm.astro';
---
<div class="floating-actions" data-floating-actions>
  <button class="floating-actions__top" type="button" data-scroll-top aria-label="Kembali ke bagian atas halaman" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">&uarr;</span></button>
  <button class="floating-actions__contact" type="button" data-contact-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="contact-dialog">
    <span class="floating-actions__whatsapp" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/icons/whatsapp-mark.svg" width="28" height="28" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </span>
    <span><small>WhatsApp RAMUNI</small>Konsultasi gratis</span>
  </button>
</div>
<span class="scroll-top-sentinel" data-scroll-top-sentinel aria-hidden="true"></span>
<dialog class="contact-dialog" id="contact-dialog" data-contact-dialog aria-labelledby="contact-dialog-title" aria-label="Konsultasi bersama tim RAMUNI">
  <div class="contact-dialog__panel">
    <header class="contact-dialog__header">
      <span class="contact-dialog__avatar" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/icons/whatsapp-mark.svg" width="24" height="24" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></span>
      <div><small>Tim RAMUNI</small><strong id="contact-dialog-title">Ceritakan kebutuhan usaha Anda</strong><span class="contact-dialog__status">Biasanya dibalas lewat WhatsApp</span></div>
      <button class="contact-dialog__close" type="button" data-contact-close aria-label="Tutup percakapan">×</button>
    </header>
    <div class="contact-dialog__conversation">
      <p>Halo! Pilih masalah usaha yang ingin dibahas, lalu kirim kontak Anda.</p>
      <p>Setelah formulir diterima, kami lanjutkan obrolan di WhatsApp resmi RAMUNI.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-dialog__form">
      <LeadForm kind="contact" mode="progressive" handoff="whatsapp" location="floating-consultation" submitLabel="Kirim lalu buka WhatsApp" compact />
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>
<script is:inline type="module" src="/scripts/floating-contact.js"></script>
